e business model. Risk is extensively detailed in 10-K with emphasis on impact to margins, sales and inventory. Central operational risk with stable trend. Citation: \"Merchandise margin reflects lower freight costs and lower inventory shrink expense\". Position: milieu Item 1A.", "trend": "stable", "summary": "Ineffective execution of opportunistic buying or inventory management could harm margins, sales and customer experience", "score": 4}, {"title": "Consumer trend adaptation challenges", "category": "Concurrence", "severity": 4, "score_rationale": "Significant competitive risk given rapid consumer preference changes. Directly impacts customer loyalty and multi-brand performance. Stable but critical in volatile retail environment. Citation: \"Uncertainty remains regarding the continued impact on our direct imports, indirect imports, vendor and competitor\". Position: haut Item 1A.", "trend": "stable", "summary": "Inability to anticipate or follow consumer trends could reduce sales and store/online traffic", "score": 4}, {"title": "Concurrence retail accrue", "category": "Concurrence", "severity": 4, "score_rationale": "Detailed risk description highlighting larger, better-capitalized, more technologically agile competitors. Structural disadvantage potential. Highly weighted competitive risk. Citation: \"Uncertainty remains regarding the continued impact on our direct imports, indirect imports, vendor and competitor\". Position: haut Item 1A.", "trend": "stable", "summary": "Pressure from larger competitors with e-commerce and technology advantages threatens market share and profitability", "score": 4, "title_en": "Intensifying retail competition"}, {"title": "Perturbations de la chaîne d'approvisionnement mondiale", "category": "Géopolitique", "severity": 5, "score_rationale": "Multi-factor risk (geopolitical, pandemic, sanctions, climate, labor) with direct impact on product availability and costs. Highly concerned language with repetition across multiple sections. Trend escalating vs prior year. Citation: \"Recent Events and Trends Global Economic Conditions and Tariffs We continue to closely monitor changes\". Position: haut Item 1A.", "trend": "up", "summary": "International supply interruptions from geopolitical, health or environmental factors may impact availability and costs", "score": 5, "title_en": "Global supply chain disruptions"}, {"title": "Défaillances de cybersécurité et des systèmes informatiques", "category": "Cybersécurité", "severity": 5, "score_rationale": "Critical risk with potential for material losses, legal liability and reputation damage. Alarming language present in filing. Increasing trend due to growing digital system dependency. Citation: \"Merchandise margin reflects lower freight costs and lower inventory shrink expense\". Position: milieu Item 1A.", "trend": "up", "summary": "Security breach or system failure could cause data loss, high costs and customer trust damage", "score": 5, "title_en": "Cybersecurity and IT system failures"}, {"title": "Complexité opérationnelle à grande échelle", "category": "Industriel", "severity": 4, "score_rationale": "Risk from managing large global organization with brand autonomy. Issues around coordination, compliance and information sharing highlighted. Serious but preventive language tone. Stable trend. Citation: \"Currency translation generally does not affect operating margins, or affects them only slightly, as sales\". Position: milieu Item 1A.", "trend": "stable", "summary": "Managing large-scale global operations could create inefficiencies, process failures or control breakdowns", "score": 4, "title_en": "Operational complexity at scale"}, {"title": "Marketing effectiveness challenges", "category": "Concurrence", "severity": 3, "score_rationale": "Well-documented risk regarding digital algorithm changes and advertising competition. Secondary importance relative to other risks. Cautious but not alarming language. Stable vs prior year. Citation: \"Tr